        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9040, Ridged Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe simplicity of this Traditional Ridged Cabinet Pull is what makes it so beautiful, allowing the stunning finishes to stand out and make a statement. It is available in 6 finishes. The Ridged Cabinet Door Pull is available in 3 sizes ranging from 3-1/2 inches up to 7 inches. It is perfect for use in the kitchen on cabinets and all other lightweight doors and drawers. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/traditional-ridged-appliance-pull-omnia-ap-9040\"><b>Traditional Ridged Appliance Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/large-traditional-ridged-cabinet-pull-omnia-9040\"><b>Larger Traditional Ridged Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 sizes</b>:\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9040/89</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 9/16\"</li> \r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>9040/128</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 5/8\"</li> \r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>9040/178</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 11/16\"</li> \r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/lion-head-door-stop.jpg?v=1704354585\" width=\"514\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
