                "title": "Traditional Ridged Cabinet Pull",
                "description": "The simplicity of this Traditional Ridged Cabinet Pull is what makes it so beautiful, allowing the stunning finishes to stand out and make a statement. It is available in 6 finishes. The Ridged Cabinet Door Pull is available in 3 sizes ranging from 3-1/2 inches up to 7 inches. It is perfect for use in the kitchen on cabinets and all other lightweight doors and drawers. \r\n",
